        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Current-scope conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• One clinic branch; each department has one room in the current release.&lt;br/&gt;• Doctors and patients do not log in.&lt;br/&gt;• Financial records are immutable; corrections use reversing or new movements.&lt;br/&gt;• Offline access is read-only and creates no synchronization queue.&lt;br/&gt;• Operational deletion uses archive / soft delete." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2937;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
