        <mxCell id="cs-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Critical database constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• DepartmentId is unique in Room to enforce one room per department.&lt;br/&gt;• Prevent overlap for Room, Doctor and reserved Device inside one transaction.&lt;br/&gt;• AppointmentService stores price, duration and discount snapshots.&lt;br/&gt;• Use RowVersion or an equivalent concurrency token on appointments.&lt;br/&gt;• Archived resources remain referenced by historical appointments." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2937;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="760" width="620" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
