        <mxCell id="fp-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Financial invariants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• Payment method allocations must sum to Payment.Amount.&lt;br/&gt;• Appointment/package allocations must sum to Payment.Amount.&lt;br/&gt;• Refund total cannot exceed the refundable balance of the original payment.&lt;br/&gt;• Expected cash = opening + cash collections − cash refunds − approved withdrawals.&lt;br/&gt;• Secretary enters actual cash before expected cash and variance are revealed.&lt;br/&gt;• Confirmed financial rows are never edited or deleted." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2937;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1570" y="560" width="650" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
