        <mxCell id="ia-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Security decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• Current roles are exactly Admin and Secretary.&lt;br/&gt;• Admin creates secretary accounts; there is no self-registration.&lt;br/&gt;• Lock the account temporarily after five failed sign-in attempts.&lt;br/&gt;• Passwords, tokens and secrets must never appear in AuditLog.&lt;br/&gt;• Audit retention is at least six months, pending the final production policy.&lt;br/&gt;• ApprovalRequest supports paid cancellations, refunds and other protected actions." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2937;dashed=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
